      "title": "check_tfs.py: add a flag to count usage of common elements",
      "message": "check_tfs.py: add a flag to count usage of common elements\n\nSome of them are not used at all.  Grepping the output shows:\n\n*** tfs_ack_nack IS NOT USED! ***\n*** tfs_allow_block IS NOT USED! ***\n*** tfs_restricted_allowed IS NOT USED! ***\n*** tfs_accept_reject IS NOT USED! ***\n*** tfs_found_not_found IS NOT USED! ***\n*** tfs_downlink_uplink IS NOT USED! ***\n*** tfs_c2s_s2c IS NOT USED! ***\n\nIn a lot of cases, probably someone added and entry plus the opposite\norder, which was never needed.\n",
